// REQUIRES: long
// P03.22 Done-when size for the hierarchy checks: the `abschain` shape of
// extends-stress.test at 200000 types, one test per shape so lit runs the
// shapes in parallel (the ASan build must stay under 60 s for all of them).
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-extends-stress.py abschain 200000 > %t.gopp
// RUN: timeout 60 %gopp check -check-j=1 %t.gopp
package main
